		(descr "Fairchild Channel F Videocart edge: 22 contacts on one face (B.Cu: the face down in the console) at 2.54 mm, pins 1-11 / key slot / 12-22, pin 1 (GND) at the left seen from the parts side.  Fingers 1.80 mm wide, copper 0.5-12.0 mm from the edge.  Tab 68.3 mm, slot 1.651 x 12.58.  Hard gold, 30-45 deg bevel.")
